Flags:
  (no command flags)
  --help      show this help

### import-midi
cicada import-midi <file.mid> -o <score.cicada> [flags]

import MIDI notes as a score

Flags:
  -o <file>           required new score path
  --quantize <step>    explicitly quantize onsets; default infers an exact grid
  --report            write JSON import report to stderr
  --help              show this help

Imports fixed-tempo 4/4 notes and velocity. Timing edits, cross-bar retriggers, and drum velocity quantization are counted. Controller, program and expression events are not imported.

### golden
cicada golden [flags]

